    "body": "Problem:\r\nOn :restart, the new Nvim may \"inherit\" a local dir as its global CWD.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nInherit the global CWD explicitly.\r\n\r\nRelates to #39239 and more specifically this [comment](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/39239#issuecomment-5224838785)\r\n",
