            "body": "Hmm, find sth weird, using `edit [dirname]` and enter the subdir, at this time,  check `/proc/pid/cwd` find that we are in the subdir, so `dir.lua` change the `cwd` of nvim?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/64a301184ef39a0653c99c8edc1b63cd3fd16236/src/nvim/event/libuv_proc.c#L141-L145\r\n\r\n> `dir.lua` change the `cwd` of nvim?\r\n\r\nhere the state of `uvproc->uvopts` supporting my view, `uvopts->cwd==null`, so by default, `uv` would spawn the child according to `cwd` of parent. Better check it out.",
