        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I believe the path is that `update_cwd` in `window.c` calls `os_chdir`, which calls `uv_chdir` which gets inherited when restarting.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/2edb1c000958952c87edda596ed9ed53628084ed/src/nvim/window.c#L5366\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/2edb1c000958952c87edda596ed9ed53628084ed/src/nvim/os/fs.c#L85-L101\r\n\r\nPretty sure that the current PR is the least invasive way to make this fix. Any feedback @justinmk ?",
            "created_at": "2026-08-16T04:45:36Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41304#issuecomment-5305771607",
