        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This makes sense to me. At least it doesn't make things worse. Can continue in https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39586\r\n\r\nI changed the commit msg to this, please confirm that I understood it correctly:\r\n\r\n```\r\nProblem:\r\nOn :restart, the new Nvim may \"inherit\" a local dir as its global CWD.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nInherit the global CWD explicitly.\r\n```",
